  "role": "bounded quantization-aware distillation test on Qwen3.5-0.8B (hybrid GDN); does training close the one-shot gap, and does Bonsai 2's 42-zero budget still cost after training? No Bonsai 2 recipe claim",
  "source": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B@2fc06364715b967f1860aea9cf38778875588b17",
